        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"b750d407-b4fa-4b08-846b-44584d29ec0a\",\"review_text\":\"I hit this app and countery because this country tirget my islam so leve this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"c104cb65-30cd-4bd9-b045-eae5a03acd22\",\"review_text\":\"Love it.\"},{\"review_id\":\"6dd315d4-ef32-4768-b259-6d8042070151\",\"review_text\":\"In the recent update, you need to upgrade to premium just to listen to the song you click. It plays rather other songs when you select a song in free plan. Bruh it makes no sense having Spotify and you pay money for every song you listen. Spotify... you gotta make this right!\"},{\"review_id\":\"48c2b734-557f-411f-a5a5-cfe33cd5f880\",\"review_text\":\"It's awesome.. i recommended u all to listen to podcasts which adds value in ur life😊\"},{\"review_id\":\"6c33d793-5965-481c-861e-4a8bb63dcf7c\",\"review_text\":\"Love тнe music\"},{\"review_id\":\"1c9ae38b-6744-4526-a6bd-937e296c5498\",\"review_text\":\"I've been using spotify for years. They've never let me down.\"},{\"review_id\":\"8afa05a0-4a07-47eb-b08c-7d00abeacd9b\",\"review_text\":\"Very high advertise very disturb\"},{\"review_id\":\"47cb170b-2bc0-4fbc-aaf3-2b2b033fa377\",\"review_text\":\"This app not good.too much ads\"},{\"review_id\":\"bc29a3ab-4856-4eb0-bc60-81890b939ca8\",\"review_text\":\"No words 🔥\"},{\"review_id\":\"f9345a7c-6da2-43ac-9204-96db24d9ae65\",\"review_text\":\"Its a great app but.. Since the new update spotify is just no💀 you cant even play your fav song over and over why did you removed that in the app idk whos idea to put random songs in your playlist who EVER thought of that is a horrible idea\"}]}"
